---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import image from '../assets/bandphoto2022adjusted2.jpg';
---
<Layout title="About" description="Meet Tinker's Damn: Courtney, Shawn, Andy, and Rob. Alternative rock covers and original grunge, stoner, and psych rock from Colorado Springs.">
  <section class="about page-section">
    <div class="page-wrap about-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">About the band</p>
        <h1>Four people. Two set lists. One questionable apostrophe.</h1>
        <div class="bio">
          <p><strong>Tinker's Damn</strong> has been playing together in Colorado Springs since 2014. The band started with covers, spent the pandemic writing originals, and eventually decided there was no good reason to choose only one.</p>
          <p><strong>Courtney</strong> sings lead and plays keys. <strong>Shawn</strong> plays guitar. <strong>Andy</strong> plays bass. <strong>Rob</strong> plays drums. All four sing, which is useful both musically and when nobody wants to admit who started the wrong verse.</p>
          <p>The cover side focuses on alternative rock from the 80s, 90s, and 2000s in Colorado Springs. The original side is grunge, stoner, and psych rock, booked across the Front Range.</p>
          <p>Our debut album, <em>From the Depths of Earl Drive</em>, is out now.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="btn btn-cover" href="/covers">Cover EPK</a>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/originals">Original EPK</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="photo-wrap"><Image src={image} alt="Courtney, Shawn, Andy, and Rob of Tinker's Damn in a brewery" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about { background: #ece4d3; color: #2a241d; }
  .about h1 { color: #2a241d; max-width: 13ch; font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem); }
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }
  .bio { margin: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 64ch; }
  .bio p { margin-bottom: .9rem; }
  .photo-wrap { border: 9px solid #fff; box-shadow: 12px 14px 0 rgba(42,36,29,.25); transform: rotate(1deg); }
  .photo-wrap :global(img) { display: block; width: 100%; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .photo-wrap { transform: none; } }
</style>
